{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"path-login","type":"text","text":"### 🔐 Path: `/login`\n\n```text\n+-------------------------------------------------------------+\n| StockFlow - Sign In                                         |\n+-------------------------------------------------------------+\n|                                                             |\n|  Email Address:                                             |\n|  [ staff@stockflow.dev                                    ] |\n|                                                             |\n|  Password:                                                  |\n|  [ ••••••••••••                                           ] |\n|                                                             |\n|  +-------------------------------------------------------+  |\n|  | [ Sign In ]                                           |  |\n|  +-------------------------------------------------------+  |\n|                                                             |\n|  Don't have an account? [ Register here ]                   |\n|                                                             |\n|  ⚠️ Alert (on error): \"Email atau password salah\"           |\n+-------------------------------------------------------------+\n```","x":-1520,"y":-250,"width":630,"height":534,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"path-products","type":"text","text":"### 📦 Path: `/products`\n\n```text\n+------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| StockFlow  |  [Products]  |  Invoices  |              [ staff@... | Logout]|\n+------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| Product Inventory                                  [ + Add Product ]   |\n|                                                                        |\n| Search: [ 🔍 Search name or SKU... ]                                   |\n|                                                                        |\n| +----------+--------------------+------------+--------+--------------+ |\n| | SKU      | Name               | Unit Price | Stock  | Actions      | |\n| +----------+--------------------+------------+--------+--------------+ |\n| | KB-01    | Mech Keyboard TKL  | Rp 850.000 | 25     | [Edit] [Del] | |\n| | MS-02    | Wireless Mouse     | Rp 350.000 | 40     | [Edit] [Del] | |\n| | MN-03    | 27\" 4K Monitor     | Rp 4.200k  | 8      | [Edit] [Del] | |\n| +----------+--------------------+------------+--------+--------------+ |\n| Showing 1-3 of 12 items               [ < Prev ]  Page 1 of 4  [ Next > ]|\n+------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n```","x":400,"y":-250,"width":740,"height":450,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"path-invoices-new","type":"text","text":"### 🧾 Path: `/invoices/new`\n\n```text\n+------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| StockFlow  |  Products  |  [Invoices]  |              [ staff@... | Logout]|\n+------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| Create New Invoice                                                     |\n|                                                                        |\n| Customer Name: [ PT Teknologi Maju      ]  Issue Date: [ 2026-09-02 ]  |\n| Due Date:      [ 2026-09-16             ]  Notes:      [ Urgent ship]  |\n|                                                                        |\n| Line Items:                                                            |\n| +-----------------------------+-------+------------+-----------------+ |\n| | Product                     | Qty   | Unit Price | Total           | |\n| +-----------------------------+-------+------------+-----------------+ |\n| | Mech Keyboard TKL (Stk: 25) | [ 2 ] | Rp 850.000 | Rp 1.700.000 [x]| |\n| | Wireless Mouse    (Stk: 40) | [ 1 ] | Rp 350.000 | Rp   350.000 [x]| |\n| +-----------------------------+-------+------------+-----------------+ |\n| [ + Add Line Item ]                                                    |\n|                                                                        |\n|                           Subtotal:  Rp 2.050.000                      |\n|                           Tax (11%): Rp   225.500                      |\n|                           Total:     Rp 2.275.500                      |\n|                                                                        |\n| [ Save as Draft ]   [ Cancel ]                                         |\n+------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n```","x":-225,"y":560,"width":750,"height":460,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"path-invoices-detail","type":"text","text":"### 🔍 Path: `/invoices/[id]`\n\n```text\n+------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| StockFlow  |  Products  |  [Invoices]  |              [ staff@... | Logout]|\n+------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| Invoice INV-2026-0001                               Status: [ ISSUED ] |\n|                                                                        |\n| Customer: PT Teknologi Maju                 Issue Date: 02 Sep 2026    |\n| Notes:    Pengiriman via kurir ekspres      Due Date:   16 Sep 2026    |\n|                                                                        |\n| Items (Snapshot):                                                      |\n| +-----------------------------+-------+------------+-----------------+ |\n| | Item Description            | Qty   | Unit Price | Total           | |\n| +-----------------------------+-------+------------+-----------------+ |\n| | Mech Keyboard TKL           | 2     | Rp 850.000 | Rp 1.700.000    | |\n| | Wireless Mouse              | 1     | Rp 350.000 | Rp   350.000    | |\n| +-----------------------------+-------+------------+-----------------+ |\n|                           Subtotal:  Rp 2.050.000                      |\n|                           Tax (11%): Rp   225.500                      |\n|                           Total:     Rp 2.275.500                      |\n|                                                                        |\n| Actions (SweetAlert confirmation dialog):                              |\n| [ Mark as Paid ]   [ Cancel Invoice (Restore Stock) ]                  |\n+------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n```","x":1000,"y":560,"width":730,"height":460,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"path-invoices-list","type":"text","text":"### 📋 Path: `/invoices`\n\n```text\n+------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| StockFlow  |  Products  |  [Invoices]  |              [ staff@... | Logout]|\n+------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| Invoices                                           [ + Create Invoice ]|\n|                                                                        |\n| Filter: [ All (12) ] [ Draft (3) ] [ Issued (5) ] [ Paid (4) ]         |\n|                                                                        |\n| +----------+--------------------+------------+-----------+-----------+ |\n| | Inv No   | Customer           | Total      | Status    | Action    | |\n| +----------+--------------------+------------+-----------+-----------+ |\n| | INV-0001 | PT Teknologi Maju  | Rp 2.275k  | [ DRAFT ] | [ View ]  | |\n| | INV-0002 | CV Makmur Abadi    | Rp 1.110k  | [ ISSUED] | [ View ]  | |\n| | INV-0003 | Toko Jaya Sentosa  | Rp 4.500k  | [ PAID  ] | [ View ]  | |\n| +----------+--------------------+------------+-----------+-----------+ |\n| Showing 1-3 of 12 invoices            [ < Prev ]  Page 1 of 4  [ Next > ]|\n+------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n```","x":-1290,"y":560,"width":800,"height":460,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"title-node","type":"text","text":"# 🖥️ StockFlow — ASCII UI Wireframes per URL Path\nVisualisasi wireframe antarmuka pengguna berbasis representasi ASCII untuk setiap path/rute aplikasi.","x":-680,"y":-800,"width":680,"height":130,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"path-register","type":"text","text":"### 📝 Path: `/register`\n\n```text\n+-------------------------------------------------------------+\n| StockFlow - Register New Account                            |\n+-------------------------------------------------------------+\n|                                                             |\n|  Full Name:                                                 |\n|  [ Staff Distribution                                     ] |\n|                                                             |\n|  Email Address:                                             |\n|  [ staff@stockflow.dev                                    ] |\n|                                                             |\n|  Password (min. 8 characters):                              |\n|  [ ••••••••••••                                           ] |\n|                                                             |\n|  +-------------------------------------------------------+  |\n|  | [ Create Account ]                                    |  |\n|  +-------------------------------------------------------+  |\n|                                                             |\n|  Already have an account? [ Sign In here ]                  |\n+-------------------------------------------------------------+\n```","x":-600,"y":-634,"width":630,"height":558,"color":"1"}
